OL,3,GNEWSATrail through city woodland points
OL,4,Ato railway past
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe area's proximity to Hadrian's Wall
OL,7,Fhas been referenced by stone carver,
OL,8,FTony Crellin, who created motifs of
OL,9,FRoman coins on a wall, while artist
OL,10,FHelen Clues put together a series of
OL,11,Fwildlife mosaics.
